+# Final Readiness Decision ΓÇö Enter Phase 13 Wave 1
+
+**Decision:** CONDITIONAL GO (Wave 1)
+
+**Date:** 2026-07-30
+
+## Rationale
+
+Phase 12 exited `READY_FOR_PHASE_13_WITH_BLOCKERS`. Forensic Wave 0 confirms there is **no** canonical `CrmActivity` plane today: no Activity parent/children models, no `/insightbooks/crm/activities` (or calls/emails/meetings/calendar/follow-ups/reminders) hubs, and no Follow-Up / Call / Email Activity / Meeting / Calendar / Reminder / automation / Activity reporting modules under `lib/admin/crm`.
+
+Phase 11/12 **do** supply a reusable foundation: polymorphic `CrmTask` (Lead + Opportunity), `CrmNote` with INTERNAL/RESTRICTED projection, `CrmTimelineEvent`, source-traceable consent/DNC/preferences, fail-closed `checkCommunicationEligibility`, SMTP via `lib/email.js` / `lib/emailService.js` (adapter-only for Wave 2), and honesty patterns from Pipeline reports/recon.
+
+WRONG_DOMAIN boundaries are clear and must stay enforced: `CsTask` / CS playbooks, Support tickets, `SupportSlaCalendar`, analytics-pipeline, Tenant POS `sales.*`, transactional platform emails, billing subscription reminders.
+
+Locked design (Activity parent + typed children; Approach B; SMTP email; Google/Outlook NOT_CONNECTED; telephony NOT_AVAILABLE; automation foundations; reporting centre in-phase) is approved and unblocked for Wave 1 spine work. No identity/consent **blocker** prevents starting Activity + Task/Note migration.
+
+## Conditions
+
+1. Activity Γëá Audit Event Γëá Analytics Event; Task Γëá Call Γëá Meeting Γëá Demo; Note Γëá outbound communication.
+2. One Activity; many timeline projections ΓÇö no duplicate Activity rows per Lead/Opportunity/Account view.
+3. Migrate/link existing CrmTask/CrmNote under Activity ΓÇö do not create a second competing task domain; never alias CsTask.
+4. Planned Γëá completed; due-date pass Γëá complete; reminder Γëá Sales contact; RSVP Γëá attendance; SMTP accept Γëá delivered.
+5. Outbound Call/Email/invitation requires server eligibility + persisted decision; UNKNOWN consent Γëá granted.
+6. No fabricated Activities, deliveries, replies, Meetings, attendance, or external calendar sync.
+7. Telephony + Call recording remain NOT_AVAILABLE; Google/Outlook remain NOT_CONNECTED (typed contracts only).
+8. Automation foundations only ΓÇö SoD, idempotent, small approved triggers; no full sequences; no AI communications; no undisclosed tracking pixels.
+9. Activity reports honesty-gated ΓÇö never false zeroes; empty ΓåÆ EMPTY/UNAVAILABLE.
+10. Owner/team/territory scope enforced server-side as hardened; no Cross-Tenant links; restricted Notes never on Customer APIs/default exports.
+11. No Tenant/Subscription/Invoice/Payment provisioning from Activity or Closed Won; CoA admin stays removed.
+12. SupportSlaCalendar / analytics-pipeline / POS sales must never authorize or alias Sales Activity/Calendar.
+13. Expected phase exit: **READY_FOR_PHASE_14_WITH_BLOCKERS** (external providers + Demo + ingest may remain blockers).
+
+## Wave 0 completion checklist
+
+- [x] Input validation vs Phase 12 handoff + READY_FOR_PHASE_13_WITH_BLOCKERS exit
+- [x] CURRENT_* audits (architecture through export)
+- [x] Quality / recon / privacy / security / performance audits
+- [x] Source / domain / task/call/email/meeting state / calendar / reminder / consent / reliability / security matrices
+- [x] Gap register + implementation plan pointer
+- [x] This decision recorded ΓÇö **CONDITIONAL GO**
+
+**Next:** User chooses **Subagent-Driven** or **Inline** execution for Waves 1ΓÇô4.  
+**Stop:** No Wave 1 application code until user continues.  
+**Skip:** `PHASE_14_READINESS_CHECKLIST.md` until Wave 4.
+
